Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:04:31.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单第三轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:04:31.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}³ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 凯斯 · 赛后转播商专访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,back from the brink of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,从失败的边缘走回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to know how did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都想知道 你怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I have to be honest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So at beginning when she was leading 5-0
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,一开始她 5-0 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and then my service game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,轮到我发球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I just talk to myself like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是这么跟自己说的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Please at least don't let her beat you 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,求你了 至少别让她 6-0 拿下你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,That was that's going to be a really shame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那真的太丢人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,if she do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果被她做到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And then at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后到了后面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,when I won the first game in the third set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,当我拿下决胜盘第一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I just said, "Okay, let's go for next game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就想 好 下一局再说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Keep going point by point."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,一分一分地打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And somehow things start to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知怎么的 事情开始变了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I saw there's more mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看到她的失误多了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,on her and I start to play more bravely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我开始打得更勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think that's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这就是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But for me the most important one is at 55
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说最关键的是 5-5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,because I already come back five game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我已经连赢了五局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in a row and then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to win those next two game I think that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,要再拿下那两局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,the most difficult one because in that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,才是最难的 因为那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,moment I felt there's more rally both
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉回合变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of us we are hitting incredible good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们俩都打得好得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So so it was actually once you got to 55
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以其实是到了 5-5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that it was even more pressure on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的压力反而更大了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would say I already start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 我会说我已经开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel pressure at 25 because I start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在 2-5 就感觉到压力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to see no the match is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我看到 比赛还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Stay there and keep fighting point by point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,留在这儿 一分一分接着拼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,But when I actually got to 55, I see okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但真到了 5-5 我就想 好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,here's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, so what did you prove to yourself today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你向自己证明了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I proved one things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我证明了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,First of all, the hard work finally pays off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 努力终于有回报了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And second things is like never give up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二件事是 永远不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,because things can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为什么都可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And third things is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三件事是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,okay, miracle exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧 奇迹是存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Miracle exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,奇迹是存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You heard it here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们在这儿第一个听到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,They do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,它们真的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Listen, this is a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,听我说 这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that you said you've been building
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你说过的 你为它铺了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on for a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,很长的路 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So all that hard work that you put in, tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你付出的那些努力 跟我们讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,讲讲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,how the struggles have kind of contributed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些挣扎是怎么造就了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to what happened out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天场上发生的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You know I I suffer a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 我吃了很多苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,this trip for four months
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这四个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,without winning matches and I have lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场球都没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of doubts of myself and after I talked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对自己有很多怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to my team we made a good preparation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我和团队谈了 做了准备
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in Florida the IMG academy those condition
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在佛罗里达的 IMG 学院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,was really really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,那里的条件真的非常热
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So when you play 20 minute tennis you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,打 20 分钟球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.52,EN,,0,0,0,,sweat from top to down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就从头湿到脚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I I don't even want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to think anymore how I made
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,再去回想 我是怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,a tough practice there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,熬过那里的训练的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And at the end when I come here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以最后来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the temperature was really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,温度舒服得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Everything seems like more easy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切好像都变容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,with the conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这样的条件下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what I say the first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我才说第一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,the hard work pays off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,努力会有回报
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,because you know in sports
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你知道 在体育里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,if you don't work hard I felt it's really really
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果不下苦功 我觉得真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,tough especially in my condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是我这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like I'm those kind of players I need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我是那种球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:36.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to work hard to get the things down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,必须靠苦练把东西练扎实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to get the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能拿到结果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of working hard I mean you came
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,through qualies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是从资格赛打上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So much respect for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这太让人敬佩了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you what what what what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,did you learn in that process coming
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在打资格赛那个过程里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,through qualies that that you think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,has helped you right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你现在能站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,being in the fourth round?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进 16 强？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, at the beginning takes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:56.32,EN,,0,0,0,,a while to prepare mentally I have to really
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得花点时间做心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.48,EN,,0,0,0,,through qual because last time I play quali
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为上一次我打资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in the grand slam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,is when I was 19 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是我 19 岁那年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So how come after five years I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么五年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at the same stage again quali
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我又回到同一个位置打资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and then okay that's that's how it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后想 好吧 事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,is and my coach told me you need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样 我的教练跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to stay humble fights every single match
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你要保持谦逊 每一场都去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,because the quali opponent they are not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为资格赛的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,easy they are someone really really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,一点都不好打 个个都非常强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,especially I think I had a really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是资格赛最后一场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the last match of quali I I show a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得非常艰难 我把情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of emotions there but this gives me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,都放了出来 但这给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the rhythm of match once I keep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛的节奏 一旦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,winning winning I felt like the dynamic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直赢一直赢 我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match match is coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛的那种感觉回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I found myself again on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上重新找回了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I found the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我找回了那团火
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I found the energy on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,找回了场上的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,New York
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,has energy unlike any other place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,的能量和任何地方都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Right now with the wind today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天还刮着风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,you've won more matches here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这里赢下的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,than any other WTA event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,比任何一站 WTA 赛事都多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:44.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.56,EN,,0,0,0,,do you think New York brings out some
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得纽约能让你打出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of your best tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的网球？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think here the crowd they are so pumped
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这里的观众特别热情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and sometimes when I'm a bit like down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候我状态往下掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the crowd like can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,观众会喊 继续啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on Queen, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,加油 Queen 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like I really get the energy from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的能从他们那里拿到能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But even when they are supporting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但就算他们在支持
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the opponent, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手 比如说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,they are supporting a lot to Maddie today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天他们给了凯斯很多支持
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I also can feel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我同样能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,when they supporting the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们支持另一个人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,they are telling me in the same time, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也在同时告诉我 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We want to see a good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们想看一场好球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,That's how I think inside of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我心里就是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you feel like your level is back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得你的状态回到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to where it was when you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,当年那个水平了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,were in the top five?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是你世界前五的时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm still on the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还在这个过程里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm still on the way, but it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还在路上 但确实
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,My level gets better every single match,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我每打一场就好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,but there's still a lot I I'm trying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还有很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想去够到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还在努力变得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 恭喜你
